      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1021,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1021,
      "text": "packages/core \u2014 three stores, one truth\n   org profile       organizations \u00b7 programs \u00b7 outcomes \u00b7 budget_lines\n   document corpus   documents \u00b7 document_chunks (embedding vector(1536))\n   funder graph      funders \u00b7 funder_contacts \u00b7 interactions\n   provenance        facts \u00b7 fact_sources \u00b7 fact_conflicts\nA fact with no source row is a bug. Conflicts surface \u2014 never auto-resolved.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "packages/core \u2014 three stores, one truth\n   org profile       organizations \u00b7 programs \u00b7 outcomes \u00b7 budget_lines\n   document corpus   documents \u00b7 document_chunks (embedding vector(1536))\n   funder graph      funders \u00b7 funder_contacts \u00b7 interactions\n   provenance        facts \u00b7 fact_sources \u00b7 fact_conflicts\nA fact with no source row is a bug. Conflicts surface \u2014 never auto-resolved.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
