      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1023,
      "text": "packages/ingestion \u2014 upload \u2192 extract \u2192 candidate facts, each with a\nconfidence score and \u22651 source span \u2192 conflict detection \u2192 confirmation\nqueue. Interprets nothing, drafts nothing, decides nothing.",
