      "seed": 1084,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1084,
      "text": "Solid boxes are ours. Dashed boxes are external vendors. Red boxes are the two gates the specs require to be structurally impossible to bypass.\n\u26a0 marks a dependency the specs rely on but no ADR has decided yet.",
